# Data

This BIDS dataset contains neuroimaging and behavioral data from the Social
Reward and Decision Neuroscience in Aging study.

Partner ratings that were collected before or after the Trust, Shared Reward,
and Ultimatum tasks are stored as subject-level behavioral recordings under
`sub-*/beh/`. The `acq-pre` and `acq-post` entities indicate collection timing.
When an acquisition was repeated, the final complete attempt is the version of
record. Missing ratings were not imputed.
